desc_save => Save camera events to this chart's camera data file. / 保存当前相机事件到此谱面的相机数据文件。
desc_save_as => Choose a different location for camera event data. / 选择相机事件数据的另存位置。
desc_open_chart => Open another chart or camera event data file. / 打开另一份谱面或相机事件数据。
desc_exit_editor => Exit the editor and return to the editor menu. / 退出编辑器并返回编辑器菜单。
desc_undo => Undo the last event or layer change. / 撤销上一次事件或图层修改。
desc_redo => Redo the last undone change. / 重做已撤销的修改。
desc_copy => Copy selected camera events. / 复制选中的相机事件。
desc_cut => Cut selected camera events. / 剪切选中的相机事件。
desc_paste => Paste copied events at the playhead. / 将复制的事件粘贴到播放头位置。
desc_duplicate => Quickly duplicate selected events to the next beat. / 将选中事件快速复制到下一拍。
desc_delete => Delete selected events. / 删除选中的事件。
desc_select_all => Select every camera event in the chart. / 选择当前曲目的全部相机事件。
desc_new_event => Create a camera event at the playhead. / 在播放头位置创建相机事件。
desc_play_pause => Play or pause the chart preview. / 播放或暂停当前谱面预览。
desc_go_start => Move the playhead to the start of the song. / 将播放头移动到曲目开头。
desc_timeline_zoom_in => Zoom in to inspect shorter time spans. / 放大时间轴，观察更细的时间间隔。
desc_timeline_zoom_out => Zoom out to see more of the song. / 缩小时间轴，查看更长的曲目区间。
desc_timeline_zoom_reset => Restore the default timeline scale. / 恢复时间轴默认比例。
desc_add_layer => Create a camera event layer. / 新建相机事件图层。
desc_remove_layer => Delete the current layer and choose how to handle its events. / 删除当前图层，并选择如何处理其中的事件。
desc_move_layer_up => Raise the current layer's display order. / 提高当前图层的显示顺序。
desc_move_layer_down => Lower the current layer's display order. / 降低当前图层的显示顺序。
desc_focus_opponent => Add an event that focuses the opponent at the playhead. / 在播放头位置添加聚焦对手角色的事件。
desc_focus_player => Add an event that focuses the player at the playhead. / 在播放头位置添加聚焦玩家角色的事件。
desc_focus_girlfriend => Add an event that focuses the girlfriend at the playhead. / 在播放头位置添加聚焦女友的事件。
desc_reset_camera_position => Reset preview camera position. / 将预览相机位置恢复到初始位置。
desc_reset_camera_zoom => Reset preview camera zoom. / 将预览相机缩放恢复到初始值。
desc_toggle_strum_preview => Show or hide chart note previews. / 显示或隐藏谱面箭头预览。
desc_toggle_passepartout => Show or hide the area outside the viewfinder. / 显示或隐藏取景框外部遮罩。
desc_toggle_extended_bounds => Show or hide extended camera bounds. / 显示或隐藏扩展相机边界。
desc_toggle_shader => Toggle preview scene shaders. / 开关预览场景的着色器效果。
desc_show_help => Show camera, timeline, and mouse operation instructions. / 显示相机事件、时间轴和鼠标操作说明。
desc_show_keybindings => Open the keyboard shortcut configuration. / 打开快捷键配置面板。
